# s1-page-virtual-client core wiring

## mixdog-workspace service.rs (owner: the page-server task's file; hot-adjacent)
Beside `"projectFs/localPage/origin"` in the dispatch add:

    "projectFs/localPage/assetType" => {
        let root = PathBuf::from(s(params, "root")?);
        let file = PathBuf::from(s(params, "file")?);
        let data_root = params.get("dataRoot").and_then(Value::as_str).map(PathBuf::from);
        let found = crate::pageserver::policy::page_asset_type(&root, &file, data_root.as_deref());
        value(json!({ "type": found.unwrap_or("") }))
    }

and add "projectFs/localPage/assetType" to the claimed-method list beside "projectFs/localPage/origin" (service.rs ~line 1821). Local origin only,
like origin. No SERVICE_PENDING change (the workspace service is already registered).
Test (mixdog-workspace tests/it/desktop_files.rs): assetType of a css under root is "text/css"; a dotted segment, a file outside root and an unknown extension answer "".
